1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
Little Moments.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,667
The After-School Club Choice.

3
00:00:03,667 --> 00:00:06,479
The school hallway is covered with club posters.

4
00:00:06,479 --> 00:00:09,031
Emma stops in front of the art club sign.

5
00:00:09,031 --> 00:00:11,510
I stop in front of the cooking club sign.

6
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:14,240
There's a picture of a very attractive muffin on it.

7
00:00:14,474 --> 00:00:16,716
You're choosing based on the picture, aren't you?

8
00:00:16,996 --> 00:00:18,115
Partly.

9
00:00:18,115 --> 00:00:21,250
But I also want to learn how to make something besides toast.

10
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:24,083
We walk over to the teacher at the cooking club table.

11
00:00:24,083 --> 00:00:25,990
What happens at the first meeting?

12
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:30,752
We'll tour the kitchen, talk about the rules, and plan a simple snack together.

13
00:00:30,988 --> 00:00:32,959
Do I need any experience?

14
00:00:33,196 --> 00:00:34,283
No.

15
00:00:34,283 --> 00:00:36,023
Beginners are welcome.

16
00:00:36,023 --> 00:00:39,283
Bring your curiosity, and we'll start with the basics.

17
00:00:39,506 --> 00:00:40,550
It sounds fun.

18
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,612
But I still really want to try art club.

19
00:00:42,892 --> 00:00:44,907
We don't have to choose the same one.

20
00:00:44,907 --> 00:00:48,104
You can show me what you make, and I can tell you what I cook.

21
00:00:48,338 --> 00:00:50,069
Can you also bring me what you cook?

22
00:00:50,356 --> 00:00:53,256
That depends on the recipe and our sharing rules.

23
00:00:53,256 --> 00:00:56,058
But you'll definitely have stories to exchange.

24
00:00:56,332 --> 00:01:00,086
We check the meeting days and take the sign-up information home for our parents.

25
00:01:00,086 --> 00:01:03,138
Emma points out that both clubs meet on Wednesdays.

26
00:01:03,362 --> 00:01:05,552
We can still walk home together afterward.

27
00:01:05,836 --> 00:01:07,038
Perfect.

28
00:01:07,038 --> 00:01:11,017
You'll have paint on your hands, and I'll probably have flour on my sleeves.

29
00:01:11,017 --> 00:01:13,476
Different clubs, same walk home.

30
00:01:13,476 --> 00:01:15,715
I look once more at the muffin picture.

31
00:01:15,715 --> 00:01:19,663
I hope my curiosity is ready, because my appetite certainly is.
